<!--
______________________________________________________________________________________________
_____________________ Namalsk ZensTreasure Photos types ______________________________________
	- This adds the 26 Namalsk treasure photos to your server's loot economy.
	- Namalsk uses different loot tags than vanilla DayZ, so Zen's types wont spawn photos.
	- Either add these entries to your server's "\mpmissions\namalsk\db\types.xml" file, 
	  or swap the contents of the "zen_treasure.xml" with this if using Zen's CE files. 
	- If adding to your existing types.xml file, insert this AFTER the final </type> entry, 
	  but BEFORE the final </types> tag at the bottom of the file :)
______________________________________________________________________________________________
-->

